{"spec": "v1", "title": "选择题：物块滑上传送带", "stem": "水平传送带以 2 m/s 向右匀速运动，物块以 4 m/s 向右滑上传送带，μ = 0.2，传送带足够长，g = 10 m/s²。下列说法正确的是：", "constants": {"g": 10}, "params": {"u": [2, "m/s", "传送带速度"], "v0": [4, "m/s", "物块初速度"], "mu": [0.2, "", "动摩擦因数"]}, "scene": {"surfaces": [{"id": "带", "from": [0, 0], "to": [30, 0], "mu": "mu", "speed": "u"}], "bodies": [{"id": "物块", "m": 1, "on": "带", "at": 1, "v": "v0"}], "tMax": 3}, "asks": [{"id": "A", "text": "物块先减速后匀速", "option": {"label": "A", "text": "物块先减速后匀速", "correct": true}, "at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "物块", "to": "带"}, "expr": "v(物块)", "answer": 2}, {"id": "B", "text": "减速阶段的加速度大小为 4 m/s²", "option": {"label": "B", "text": "减速阶段的加速度大小为 4 m/s²", "correct": false}, "at": {"event": "time", "t": 0.5}, "expr": "abs(a(物块))", "answer": 2}, {"id": "C", "text": "减速所用时间为 1 s", "option": {"label": "C", "text": "减速所用时间为 1 s", "correct": true}, "at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "物块", "to": "带"}, "expr": "t", "answer": 1}, {"id": "D", "text": "物块相对传送带滑动 3 m", "option": {"label": "D", "text": "物块相对传送带滑动 3 m", "correct": false}, "at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "物块", "to": "带"}, "expr": "dx(物块) - u*t", "answer": 1}], "idea": "物块比传送带快时受向后的摩擦力减速，共速后一起匀速。", "solution": {"A": [{"say": "物块比带快，摩擦力向左，减速。", "at": {"event": "time", "t": 0.3}, "show": {"forces": ["物块"]}}, {"say": "减到和带一样快之后没有相对运动，一起匀速。", "at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "物块", "to": "带"}}], "B": [{"say": "减速阶段只有滑动摩擦力。", "tex": "a=\\mu g=2\\ \\mathrm{m/s^2}", "at": {"event": "time", "t": 0.5}, "show": {"forces": ["物块"]}}], "C": [{"say": "从 4 m/s 减到 2 m/s。", "tex": "t=\\dfrac{4-2}{2}=1\\ \\mathrm{s}", "at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "物块", "to": "带"}}], "D": [{"say": "这 1 s 内物块走 3 m，带走 2 m。", "tex": "\\Delta x=3-2=1\\ \\mathrm{m}\\ne3\\ \\mathrm{m}", "at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "物块", "to": "带"}}]}}